&lt;p&gt;Ably&#39;s back office platform is where every customer account is managed. It holds the packages, entitlements and limits that determine what each of our customers can do, and it runs the tooling our Finance, Customer Success and Support teams rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take ownership of a platform the whole business depends on, with the scope to decide how it should work rather than maintain someone else&#39;s decisions. You&#39;ll be hands-on across entitlements, administration tooling and billing, working closely with our Head of Infrastructure and our Developer Experience team, and directly with the teams who use what you build.&lt;/p&gt;
