&lt;li&gt;Own the design, delivery, and operation of complex data pipelines, datasets, and platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and analytical requirements into scalable data models, reliable data products, and clear technical plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve data architecture, storage, processing, and orchestration patterns for large-scale workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve data quality, observability, lineage, and incident response for critical datasets and pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve challenging performance, reliability, and data-correctness issues in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable tools, conventions, and automation that improve engineering productivity and reduce operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
